ard-meta\">Fyntix Editorial · 3 min read</p></div></a><a class=\"blog-card\" href=\"/feed/above-shaping-future-ready-brand-identity-in-london-through-strategy-creativity-and-ai\"><div class=\"blog-cover blog-cover--content\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"blog-cover-topic\">Content strategy</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"125\" y=\"35\" width=\"300\" height=\"245\" rx=\"28\"/><path d=\"M185 100H350M185 145H365M185 190H315M185 235H275\"/></svg><span class=\"blog-cover-word\">Make it useful.</span></div><div class=\"blog-card-copy\"><p class=\"blog-card-title\">Make your business easier to understand across every channel</p><p class=\"blog-card-summary\">Keep your offer, evidence and business information clear wherever customers encounter you, from search pages to paid campaigns.</p><p class=\"blog-card-meta\">Fyntix Editorial · 3 min read</p></div></a></div></section></aside>"
